OL,3,AThunderstorm warnings issued for parts
OL,4,Aof UK with flash flooding expected
OL,5,
OL,6,FYellow thunderstorm warnings have been
OL,7,Fissued across the UK, with heavy
OL,8,Fshowers expected to lead to flash
OL,9,Fflooding and travel disruption.
OL,11,FThe Met Office warnings will come into
OL,12,Fforce across northern England, Northern
OL,13,FIreland and eastern Scotland later in
OL,14,Fthe day on Wednesday. The warning for
OL,15,Fnorthern England will remain in place
OL,16,Funtil Thursday morning.
OL,18,FThe downpours follow almost two months
OL,19,Fof dry weather, with parts of the
OL,20,Fcountry experiencing their first rain
OL,21,Fin weeks on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
